{"content":"To calculate the percentage change in working capital from 2015 to 2016, we need to use the formula for percentage change:\n\n\\[ \\text{Percentage Change} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{New Value} - \\text{Old Value}}{\\text{Old Value}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nHere, the \"New Value\" is the working capital at the end of 2016, and the \"Old Value\" is the working capital at the end of 2015.\n\nFrom the table:\n- Working capital at December 31, 2016 (New Value) = 1,279,337 (in thousands)\n- Working capital at December 31, 2015 (Old Value) = 1,019,953 (in thousands)\n\nNow, let's calculate the percentage change:\n\n\\[ \\text{Percentage Change} = \\left( \\frac{1,279,337 - 1,019,953}{1,019,953} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nLet's perform the calculation using the `calculate` tool.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the percentage change in working capital from 2015 to 2016.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"( ( 1279337 - 1019953 ) / 1019953 ) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"1279337\": {\"value\": 1279337, \"unit\": \"thousand\"},\n      \"1019953\": {\"value\": 1019953, \"unit\": \"thousand\"}\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":12.456482545938343,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":414,"generated_token_ids":[1249,11047,279,11414,2297,304,3238,6722,504,220,17,15,16,20,311,220,17,15,16,21,11,582,1184,311,990,279,14806,369,11414,2297,1447,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,10388,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,90,3564,5162,92,481,1124,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,35702,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,8420,11,279,330,3564,5162,1,374,279,3238,6722,518,279,835,315,220,17,15,16,21,11,323,279,330,18284,5162,1,374,279,3238,6722,518,279,835,315,220,17,15,16,20,382,3830,279,1965,510,12,22150,6722,518,6652,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,16,21,320,3564,5162,8,284,220,16,11,17,22,24,11,18,18,22,320,258,9037,340,12,22150,6722,518,6652,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,16,20,320,18284,5162,8,284